<title>UK: Sugar freighter off Veracruz with engine problems.</title>
<headline>Sugar freighter off Veracruz with engine problems.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Romanian-flagged freighter Oituz carrying 13,000 tonnes of sugar, was anchored 130 miles off Veracruz, Mexico, with engine trouble, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 15,000 dwt vessel was reported to have sustained damage to the No.5 cylinder as a result of failing exhaust valves.</p>
</text>
